              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJoshuwa nabo bonke abakwa-Israyeli kanye naye bathatha u-Akani indodana kaSeraki nesiliva nengubo nesigqoko segolide, namadodana akhe namadodakazi akhe nezinkomo zakhe nezimbongolo zakhe nezimvu zakhe netende lakhe nakho konke ayenakho, baliyisa esigodini sase-Agori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
